e=\"font-size:23px\">&quot;</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26805,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26805-abesolus","user":"Abesolus","date":". 05-25-2021, 05:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26805-abesolus","name":"Abesolus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T14:11:54-07:00","id":1449587,"title":"","content":"The woman on the cover seems oddly familiar...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T14:32:52-07:00","id":1449589,"title":"","content":"Sigh...NPC bad guys...whelp I am disappointed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T14:43:03-07:00","id":1449590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449579#post1449579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Contains information on the Gehenna War, and how the Sabbat opposes the dread Antediluvians.<br /> <br /> New tools to expand your chronicles, including Discipline powers,, and the horrifying Ritae of the Black Hand.</div> </div> </div> </div> I hope they have a new strategy. The old strategy of &quot;force feeding Sabbat members to the ancients and being the puppets of the ancients&quot; was not a good strategy. I do want to know what emerged from the Gehenna War.<br /> Is &quot;ritae&quot; supposed to be plural? Is this a reference to all the rites and rituals of the sect, or some new singular rite?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T18:05:31-07:00","id":1449595,"title":"","content":"So I have 2 major concerns about this book:<br /> <br /> * No rules to play Sabbat vampires. The company i forcing all player to confirm to their wishe intead of like in V1-v20 allow the player to decide what to play and give them good rules for that,<br /> <br /> * ONly available to US player as of now. I prefer OPP to Modiphius and Renegade Games as OPP delivers to all their fans,<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25995-ethryo","name":"Ethryo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T19:19:01-07:00","id":1449601,"title":"","content":"Shipping outside of the US will be a matter of time for hard copies and the PDF should be available to anyone.<br /> <br /> As for the playing the Sabbat... that does seem to be an issue. I hope some of the people involved in the book respond to that observation. This is damning with faint praise, but the material should be easy to hack and made useful for play by Storytellers and players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T19:24:44-07:00","id":1449603,"title":"","content":"It is weird that they aren't marketing anything towards Sabbat players. Is our money not green enough for them? There's an entire section of their consumer base who run, and have always run, the Sabbat as our default sect, and have zero interest in being forced to play Cammies and Anarchs.<br /> <br /> You can't just make us play Cammies or Anarchs. All your attempts to force this on us have accomplished is costing you money, as we seek out free homebrew stuff to bring our sect back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T19:38:32-07:00","id":1449607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449601#post1449601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Shipping outside of the US will be a matter of time for hard copies and the PDF should be available to anyone.<br /> <br /> As for the playing the Sabbat... that does seem to be an issue. I hope some of the people involved in the book respond to that observation. This is damning with faint praise, but the material should be easy to hack and made useful for play by Storytellers and players.</div> </div> </div> </div>The response on Discord from Paradox reps basically seems to be ' suck it, do it yourself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T19:49:22-07:00","id":1449609,"title":"","content":"There's a paradox discord?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T20:28:52-07:00","id":1449610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449609#post1449609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a paradox discord?</div> </div> </div> </div>The official WoD Discord?<br /> <br /> There's similar statements on Twitter from Outstar and Achilli....but they're super long tweet threads to dig through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26564,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","user":"BadFurryFanFic","date":". 05-25-2021, 11:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","name":"BadFurryFanFic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T20:37:54-07:00","id":1449611,"title":"","content":"I've generally been on the fence about 5th edition, but locking the Sabbat off as NPCs pretty much kills this edition for me. Guess I'll be sticking to V20 and just hope for a 6th edition someday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T20:49:14-07:00","id":1449613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449611#post1449611\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've generally been on the fence about 5th edition, but locking the Sabbat off as NPCs pretty much kills this edition for me. Guess I'll be sticking to V20 and just hope for a 6th edition someday.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just use Long Road Out Of Hell.<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1N7z5WJa4WcghanB-mSGqdqIymRB7vteu/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1N7z...ymRB7vteu/view</a> It's free. They haven't stopped us, they've just stopped themselves from getting our money.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T21:11:40-07:00","id":1449614,"title":"","content":"I think it's weird not to do Sabbat PCs.<br /> <br /> Is it overcompensation for the fact that they received such shit over the pedophile Ventrue Sample character and the Alt-Right Brujah Concept?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T21:19:55-07:00","id":1449615,"title":"","content":"If so, it's misquided. Believing that imitating the behavior of a wolf is the path to spiritual enlightenment is too far removed from anything real world to provoke the sort of backlash that the above two examples caused. Those trigger many people because they are too real-world for a fantasy game, even a so-called &quot;gritty&quot; fantasy game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-25T22:12:41-07:00","id":1449617,"title":"","content":"NPC factions are wastes of paper and time. I don't need a 140 page book of &quot;Don't play this&quot; I've got plenty of those from earlier edition. I don't need mechanics for paths for NPCs. But honestly given how.... random shit is with 5e I expect this then a &quot;Players guide ot the sabbat&quot; because actually having a guiding vision seems to be beyond it. I can't wait for 2045 and Mage 5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T00:16:20-07:00","id":1449621,"title":"","content":"Ah, Paradox. Back to beating us with the 'Stop it with your badwrongfun' stick again. I'm so utterly crushed and tired with this stuff.<br /> <br /> I had literally just added this to my cart and made an account with them. But I'm officially out. I can't keep sinking money into this when they quite literally and quite vocally don't care.<br /> <br /> Incidentally, I see there's a new screen with new artwork. I guess it just fixes the revised Blood Potency table?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T00:26:14-07:00","id":1449624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449621#post1449621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, Paradox. Back to beating us with the 'Stop it with your badwrongfun' stick again. I'm so utterly crushed and tired with this stuff.<br /> <br /> I had literally just added this to my cart and made an account with them. But I'm officially out. I can't keep sinking money into this when they quite literally and quite vocally don't care.<br /> <br /> Incidentally, I see there's a new screen with new artwork. I guess it just fixes the revised Blood Potency table?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Its that real 90s feel! &quot;Here's a whole bunch of things you can't play and you shouldn't play. Here's how we treat them with game mechanics as playable&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T00:27:48-07:00","id":1449625,"title":"","content":"Hmmmm. Justim Achilli shares his Vision of the sabbat in each edition here .<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/jachilli/status/1397444118876413953?s=21\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/jachilli/status/...876413953?s=21</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T00:32:52-07:00","id":1449626,"title":"","content":"While I'm kinda disappointed with no sabbat as player characters,I don't think it's a case of bad wrong fun. It's more that the people at paradox have decided to try and follow an specific version of the game,one that's more streamlined and focused. And that excludes some play elements of the game.<br /> They're not saying playing the sabbat is wrong,they just have an Path they want to follow and playable sabbat doesn't fit it.<br /> Does that mean I like it? No. I do want to play the sabbat,and totally understand that you guys don't like it.<br /> But I try to be positive","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T00:33:04-07:00","id":1449627,"title":"","content":"It's like playing with that ST who always has to try and 'beat' the players. It's not fun for everyone else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T00:35:19-07:00","id":1449629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449626#post1449626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I'm kinda disappointed with no sabbat as player characters,I don't think it's a case of bad wrong fun. It's more that the people at paradox have decided to try and follow an specific version of the game,one that's more streamlined and focused. And that excludes some plat elements of the game.<br /> They're not saying playing the sabbat is wrong,they just have an Path they want to follow and playable sabbat doesn't fit it.<br /> Does that mean I like it? No. I do want to play the sabbat,and totally understand that you guys don't like it.<br /> But I try to be positive</div> </div> </div> </div>But why would I plonk down money on something that may or may not be playable out of the box? If I have to homebrew it, why wouldn't I just use The Long Hard Road Out of Hell?<br /> <br /> It seems like a failure of marketing to tell me before I even buy the shiny new thing 'You can't use this'. If I can, actually, use this, then be clear about that in how you position the product.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 05-26-2021, 04:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T00:36:42-07:00","id":1449630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449629#post1449629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But why would I plonk down money on something that may or may not be playable out of the box? If I have to homebrew it, why wouldn't I just use The Long Hard Road Out of Hell?<br /> <br /> It seems like a failure of marketing to tell me before I even buy the shiny new thing 'You can't use this'. If I can, actually, use this, then be clear about that in Joe you position the product.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean,they certainly put a lot of hard work on it,so I'm sure there will be a lot of useful stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T01:13:09-07:00","id":1449631,"title":"","content":"Rant over. I just had high hopes for this book after three years, and I guess it's just a bit crushing. Oh well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T02:52:28-07:00","id":1449634,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449626#post1449626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I'm kinda disappointed with no sabbat as player characters,I don't think it's a case of bad wrong fun. It's more that the people at paradox have decided to try and follow an specific version of the game,one that's more streamlined and focused. And that excludes some play elements of the game.<br /> They're not saying playing the sabbat is wrong,they just have an Path they want to follow and playable sabbat doesn't fit it.<br /> Does that mean I like it? No. I do want to play the sabbat,and totally understand that you guys don't like it.<br /> But I try to be positive</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If playable sabbat do not fit the vision of your product make a product that laser focuses on the Sabbat. This is the WOD different focuses and scales have always been a thing. Mage doesn't play like vampire because it has a different Focus.<br /> <br /> So make Vampire: The Sabbat and have some &quot;how to use these as npcs&quot; rules.<br /> <br /> Because we all know there's going to be all sorts of options to play the Sabbat in card games. In board games.. in computer games.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449627#post1449627\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's like playing with that ST who always has to try and 'beat' the players. It's not fun for everyone else.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except they will be playable in all sorts of other media. Hell they might even show up on the Tv series or whatever. Its like a candy company that won't sell a particular type of chocolate but will rent it out to someone else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2715,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","user":"Lian","date":". 05-26-2021, 05:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T02:58:16-07:00","id":1449635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449613#post1449613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Just use Long Road Out Of Hell.<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1N7z5WJa4WcghanB-mSGqdqIymRB7vteu/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1N7z...ymRB7vteu/view</a> It's free. They haven't stopped us, they've just stopped themselves from getting our money.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>It looks cool but I'm just gonna stick with V20 for the foreseeable future. There was some stuff I liked about 5th edition and some stuff I didn't or found questionable (especially mechanics wise) but more and more it's becoming clear that the game I want to play is not the game they want to publish, and I don't think that's going to be changing. Just better, for me at least, to cut it out and focus back on V20, maybe bringing certain meta-plot ideas I like from 5th edition.<br /> <br /> And I'm not engaging in edition wars or anything, like I said, there's stuff in 5th edition I like. Overall though it's just becoming apparent is not the game for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T03:22:08-07:00","id":1449638,"title":"","content":"They will lose so many fan who will not buy this book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25995-ethryo","name":"Ethryo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T05:01:18-07:00","id":1449643,"title":"","content":"Do we know if the new screen has any new material in?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T08:02:58-07:00","id":1449654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ethryo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449638#post1449638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They will lose so many fan who will not buy this book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Enough will buy it for it to make money, which is a goal.<br /> <br /> I also suspect the Sabbat book will be like the Book of the Fallen - useful if you really want to run such creatures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T08:23:38-07:00","id":1449658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449635#post1449635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It looks cool but I'm just gonna stick with V20 for the foreseeable future. There was some stuff I liked about 5th edition and some stuff I didn't or found questionable (especially mechanics wise) but more and more it's becoming clear that the game I want to play is not the game they want to publish, and I don't think that's going to be changing. Just better, for me at least, to cut it out and focus back on V20, maybe bringing certain meta-plot ideas I like from 5th edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>I got there sooner, but am pretty much in the same boat; I found a few nuggets of ideas in V5 (mostly metaplot and inspiration to make starting generation a trade-off instead of something you buy with background dots)... but it\u2019s so much easier to get the experience I want out of V20 and the amount of actually usable material so thin now I have no interest in even bothering with follow-ons (ex. if you\u2019re not using V5 mechanics then the rough guidelines for the SI in the Cam book is enough to plug the V20 Hunter\u2019s Hunted II mechanics into the slots and there\u2019s nothing to be gained from a V5 SI splatbook that\u2019s going to be 90% in-character fiction and maybe half-a-dozen pages of V5 mechanics).<br /> <br /> My advice from experience on using V5\u2019s metaplot with V20 is to play it out in real time for PCs instead of making them past events. I\u2019ve gotten a ton of mileage out of the fall of the Vienna Chantry with all the players speculating and the Tremere primogen having gone missing after prepping for a mysterious trip just before the attack and his underlings now scrambling to scoop up the pieces and claim his mantle. When news of London hits the NPCs of the whole local scene are going to start running around like chickens with their heads cut off thinking for certain their city is next.<br /> <br /> As far as the Sabbat goes, I plan on incorporating the Gehenna War by having the local pack suddenly bereft of the usual support and internal strife at being overlooked by the larger Sabbat when the call for the new crusade comes (basically they heard about the crusade, reached out with \u201cwhere do you need us,\u201d got a \u201cstand by for further instructions\u201d and haven\u2019t heard anything back in a year... in my head, their superior died shortly after landing in the Middle East and the \u2018paperwork\u2019 got lost so the local pack is basically waiting for orders that will never come because the only Sabbat who even knew they existed behind Camarilla lines got eaten or thinks they\u2019ve already been deployed and wiped out... and as the cherry on the crap sundae, when they are finally discovered after the grindhouse has made victory impossible a bunch of Gehenna War survivors are gonna accuse them of cowardice/desertion because they never did go and fight.<br /> <br /> By then the brouhaha over the Brujah ganking Hardestadt will be in full swing and the local Brujah in need of allies as the other Clan elders push for the Prince to seize all their territory/assets in a naked power grab using the assassination as an excuse... so if the PCs haven\u2019t taken out the Sabbat pack by then, the Brujah and local Sabbat (almost entirely common clan antitribue) might just join forces for mutual protection as \u201cAnarchs.\u201d<br /> <br /> Finally, while there will be a Beckoning in my campaign eventually, I\u2019ve decided that for V20 it will only affect vamps of 7th Gen or lower. That will pull a couple of key elders away, but still leave the bulk of the city\u2019s population intact (whereas if I used V5\u2019s 9th or lower 95% of my named NPCs and half of the PCs would be departing for the Middle East).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T08:35:33-07:00","id":1449659,"title":"","content":"For me, I love the simplicity of the dice mechanics now, and I love the Messy Critical/Bestial Failure mechanic. So I'm keeping the core new mechanics. It's the meta-plot changes I hate. The Sabbat being &quot;Poochie flew to his home planet. Poochie died on the way to his home planet&quot; thing they did to the Sabbat angers me. The Predator types don't fit Sabbat, so I've had to homebrew that. And, of course, I've had to use Long Road Out Of Hell for paths. That said, while it frustrates me to need to use a homebrew suppliment, I like Beast Marks much better than I ever did the rules for Paths, which is to say just making you have Humanity 3 in most mechanical respects. That was always bland. Beast Marks are fun! :-D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T09:00:40-07:00","id":1449666,"title":"","content":"Here's my problem with &quot;You guys can just homebrew it&quot;, you are basically saying to me as a consumer (and primary Sabbat player and ST) you aren't welcome in our edition of the game. I don't need to be told that &quot;Hey you can use D&amp;D 5e to run Dragonball Z if you want.&quot;. I already realize that fact. What I want as a consumer of a product is to be able to buy a product, and use only that product if if I want to run the game. Having something that was an available option within the game line for decades and be suddenly told &quot;no not anymore&quot; is really feeling like being pushed out.<br /> <br /> The fact that myself and those of the consumer base like me have no real place or feeling of being welcomed anymore into the product is really sad to me. I don't want to edition war. I wish I had an option by the book I buy to play V5. I don't. My hope is only they change their mind or OOP is allowed to continue V20 in some form or another (pipe dream).<br /> <br /> Again, I'm just really disappointed. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3215-supersabbatst","name":"SuperSabbatST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"196"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T11:52:14-07:00","id":1449678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ethryo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449638#post1449638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They will lose so many fan who will not buy this book.</div> </div> </div> </div>If they haven't lost them already, they won't be losing any new ones.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T11:54:25-07:00","id":1449679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449678#post1449678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If they haven't lost them already, they won't be losing any new ones.</div> </div> </div> </div>no, this defenitly was the last straw for several ppl","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25992-archderd","name":"archderd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T12:31:32-07:00","id":1449683,"title":"","content":"Out of curiosity, how many of you play material in a &quot;Rules as Written&quot; kind of way? Speaking myself I always alter everything in an RPG book to suit myself. My standard is a book should be mostly useful and require little hand waving on my part - but I go in assuming I will change things to suit me. All that to say while I am (somewhat) disappointed by a lack of direct PC options in the book, I can handle it and make it work for me. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T12:48:25-07:00","id":1449687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449683#post1449683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Out of curiosity, how many of you play material in a &quot;Rules as Written&quot; kind of way? Speaking myself I always alter everything in an RPG book to suit myself. My standard is a book should be mostly useful and require little hand waving on my part - but I go in assuming I will change things to suit me. All that to say while I am (somewhat) disappointed by a lack of direct PC options in the book, I can handle it and make it work for me.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>it's not so much that you need to homebrew some things, it's more so the amount and i prefere homebrewing when i'm adding my own ideas into a system not trying to fix it and V5 very much feels like i'm doing the dev's job","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25992-archderd","name":"archderd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T13:03:28-07:00","id":1449691,"title":"","content":"It's also that it is simply much easier to convince an ST to let you use something if it is canon. You have to polish your Charisma stat in real life to get them to accept a homebrew. I've found this particularly frustrating with Touchstones, because ST's will insist you take human touchstones and then forget about them. As much as I hate them, I tried to make this stalking Bella Swan shit work. And it just doesn't. But a lot of ST's are rules-as-written, and that's that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T13:14:11-07:00","id":1449693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449683#post1449683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Out of curiosity, how many of you play material in a &amp;quot;Rules as Written&amp;quot; kind of way? Speaking myself I always alter everything in an RPG book to suit myself. My standard is a book should be mostly useful and require little hand waving on my part - but I go in assuming I will change things to suit me. All that to say while I am (somewhat) disappointed by a lack of direct PC options in the book, I can handle it and make it work for me. <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not trying to prove any discussion points here, but simply just because you\u2019re curious: In my experience, very little house ruling and home brewing in the groups I\u2019ve been involved with. For the most part, having sensible, defined terms and limits gives people something to push back on or think around. Trying to figure out how to work within and around the rules sharpens wits and feels even more satisfying when you come up with something that works. <br /> <br /> Sometimes a player comes up with something that maybe shouldn\u2019t work but is too damn cool to say no. Those moments are great. Too much Golden Ruling and you lose that. Too many wonky, non-existent or badly implemented rules detracts from that. <br /> <br /> Gameplay should definitely have Calvinball aspects, but should also be part Chess, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24351-garygeneric","name":"Garygeneric","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T14:34:23-07:00","id":1449697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Abesolus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449586#post1449586\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">friends....<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"font-size:23px\">The book positions the Sabbat as antagonist NPCs, and provides rules, powers, and story support for this approach. The book doesn\u2019t provide rules for creating Sabbat player characters, but players are always free to adapt the rules as they desire for their home chronicles.</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#D9D9D9\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><span style=\"font-size:23px\">&quot;</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>This goes even beyond my wildest expectations of total failure. And I already had abysmal expectations for the future of V5. but I'm happy that Paradox always finds new ways to botch and disappoint. That' said, I must admit that locking the second most famous and popular sect of the setting out as a NPC only sect it's probably the worst of a long list of terrible ideas.<br /> <br /> Yeah yeah...there will be a Sabbat book for Sabbat's players they said.<br /> No, that's it, there will be no Sabbat players at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 05-26-2021, 05:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T14:55:55-07:00","id":1449700,"title":"","content":"Did Paradox ever say there was going to be a book for Sabbat players or did they just say there would be a Sabbat book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T15:06:38-07:00","id":1449703,"title":"","content":"I think this is a silly action but I'm also 99.99% sure that it will have all the rules for making Sabbat PCs. They'll just be the same rules for making Sabbat NPCs.<br /> <br /> After all, there's no point making Paths of Enlightenment for NPCs.<br /> <br /> No one rolls for Path checks for NPCs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T15:12:57-07:00","id":1449705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449703#post1449703\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think this is a silly action but I'm also 99.99% sure that it will have all the rules for making Sabbat PCs. They'll just b