on__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i should point out that a Touchstone is not a Bella Swan,it doesn't need to be a romantic relatonship. An touchstone can be an enemy,and rival,even someone you otherwise hate. it can be someone you admire in a non romantic way too.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't care. Not stalking a human for anything but a quick meal. And I want my Paths of Enlightenment back. It is fun to roleplay advancing on an alien spirituality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T17:27:12-07:00","id":1449733,"title":"","content":"i'm sure most of us know the woman in the cover is Lucita but seeing this tweet made me happy anyways <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/jachilli/status/1397498015166959617\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/x-web/assets/og/default-og.a2e144f0cf66.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/jachilli/status/1397498015166959617\" target=\"_blank\"> Post Not Found - X | 404 Error </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/jachilli/status/1397498015166959617\" target=\"_blank\"> https://twitter.com/jachilli/status/1397498015166959617 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The post you're looking for could not be found or may have been deleted. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T17:40:15-07:00","id":1449734,"title":"","content":"Perhaps another approach to house ruling touchstones would help? What if they just weren't included? Convictions could exist without them. Ideally, I'd suggest something like attaching them to levels of humanity, much like VtR touchstones and a little like hierarchies of sin, but without official backing, that could be difficult to standardise between tables.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T19:20:33-07:00","id":1449738,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449733#post1449733\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i'm sure most of us know the woman in the cover is Lucita but seeing this tweet made me happy anyways<br /> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/jachilli/status/1397498015166959617\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/jachilli/status/1397498015166959617</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Well I admit to a certain level of disappointment. Lucita as a Sabbat always felt like it gutted her character. I guess I'll just have to move to my next favorite vampire girl.<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.redd.it/qajus7uxsw321.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> Seriously, after 800 years of rebelling against her vile sire, she defects to join the sect that he helped create and embraces murdering a bunch of children and a pathetic miscreation of the Road of Night (which was originally about fighting for justice and punishing evil), AGAIN, founded by her sire. This after the Sabbat was revealed to have done nothing but serve the Antediluvians will and that their entire crusade against the Camarilla was based on faulty logic since the Lasombra Antediluvian was alive as was the Tzimisce one.<br /> <br /> Now even when half the Lasombra have got the message, Lucita sticks with it.<br /> <br /> It's just...sad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 05-26-2021, 10:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T19:36:01-07:00","id":1449739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spencer from The Hills</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449734#post1449734\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perhaps another approach to house ruling touchstones would help? What if they just weren't included? Convictions could exist without them. Ideally, I'd suggest something like attaching them to levels of humanity, much like VtR touchstones and a little like hierarchies of sin, but without official backing, that could be difficult to standardise between tables.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like Touchstones. I just don't like HUMAN touchstones. I have, for example, the graveyard where I received the Creation Rites as one of my touchstones on one of my Sabbat characters. It has been tremendous fun roleplaying interacting with this, mainly in the sense of cleaning it of litter and graffiti and fighting/bargaining to keep my access to it. And I've immensely enjoyed roleplaying my various Beast Marks linked to my non-human Touchstones. Touchstones of the right sort work well with Paths of Enlightenment. Human touchstones do not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T20:18:47-07:00","id":1449749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449733#post1449733\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i'm sure most of us know the woman in the cover is Lucita but seeing this tweet made me happy anyways<br /> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/jachilli/status/1397498015166959617\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/jachilli/status/1397498015166959617</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Why does she have two rows of bottom teeth? Is that Tzimise schenanigans?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T20:54:40-07:00","id":1449752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449749#post1449749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why does she have two rows of bottom teeth? Is that Tzimise schenanigans?</div> </div> </div> </div>Two rows of serrated shark teeth at that.<br /> <br /> She's secretly been Nagaraja all along? Fuck knows really, I'm gonna go with &quot; We thought it looked kewl&quot; as the actual reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T23:13:10-07:00","id":1449763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449749#post1449749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why does she have two rows of bottom teeth? Is that Tzimise schenanigans?</div> </div> </div> </div>think it's just artsy bullshit","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25992-archderd","name":"archderd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T01:31:27-07:00","id":1449773,"title":"","content":"Yeah, it's just a weird artistic overlay to make her look, I dunno, creepy I guess? I don't think Lucita is supposed to actually look exactly like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T03:03:38-07:00","id":1449777,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449683#post1449683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Out of curiosity, how many of you play material in a &quot;Rules as Written&quot; kind of way? Speaking myself I always alter everything in an RPG book to suit myself. My standard is a book should be mostly useful and require little hand waving on my part - but I go in assuming I will change things to suit me. All that to say while I am (somewhat) disappointed by a lack of direct PC options in the book, I can handle it and make it work for me.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I can count on one hand the number of times I've used houserules in the past 40 years of gaming. Assuming we're talking purely about mechanics, I pretty much ignore Metaplot utterly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26564,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","user":"BadFurryFanFic","date":". 05-27-2021, 06:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","name":"BadFurryFanFic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T04:45:58-07:00","id":1449786,"title":"","content":"As a Sabbat player, I've made my feelings about V5 and its anti-Sabbat direction known before, but considering this latest middle finger to the Sabbat I feel compelled to do so again:<br /> <br /> This pissed me off.<br /> <br /> It actually pissed me off.<br /> I tolerated V5 thus far because Revised/V20 feels old and outdated in this day and age and rolling back to V20 feels a bit like going back to AD&amp;D 2E.<br /> I liked the base mechanics, the emphasis on storytelling over mechanics. I did not like having my sect of choice cut out from the game.<br /> <br /> And just as a final note, being told to &quot;just homebrew it! Smiley emoji&quot; felt incredibly condescending and disrespectful.<br /> <br /> Anybody can homebrew <i>anything</i>. We can homebrew the entire system to being about xenomorphs instead of vampires. We don't need to be told that it's within our power.<br /> Being told that our preferred sect of choice will not be officially supported and, in the same breath, that we have <i>permission</i> to make up our own fun by pretending otherwise is condescending. <br /> <br /> We will not be relegated to gathering scraps from the floor and assembling a &quot;meal&quot; from those.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1807-serpent-axis","name":"Serpent Axis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1807_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T05:55:23-07:00","id":1449790,"title":"","content":"This is a massive blow to the fanbase. I played 5e from the alpha. I love it. But this is far too much. I endured the politics, and virtue signaling, and everything else, but this is really too much for me\u2014shame on them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24461-godforsaken","name":"Godforsaken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24461_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"150"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T06:07:10-07:00","id":1449791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449749#post1449749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why does she have two rows of bottom teeth? Is that Tzimise schenanigans?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a broken mirror image effect. Notice how her chin and jawline don't line up? I'd associate this with Malkavians and that might be close to the artist's intention, but it could also be a Lasombra reflection distortion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T06:51:41-07:00","id":1449793,"title":"","content":"I cycled rapidly through several reactions. They were all negative.<br /> I've settled on an exhausted sort of disdain.<br /> <br /> First the independents get shot. The Followers of Set have been destroyed and absorbed into Camarilla and Anarchs. The Hecata (while I like them) have supplanted the Giovanni and related enemy/rival necromancer bloodlines. The Assamites are Camarilla. I have no idea what they've done to the Ravnos, but I don't think the writers have ever known what to do with those guys. They're basically extinct anyway.<br /> Despite watching the independents disappear, I was sure the Sabbat wouldn't.<br /> <br /> And now the Sabbat have been relagated to NPC status.<br /> <br /> Why, exactly, is V5 so hellbent on everyone playing it being Anarch or Camarilla?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449683#post1449683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Out of curiosity, how many of you play material in a &quot;Rules as Written&quot; kind of way? Speaking myself I always alter everything in an RPG book to suit myself. My standard is a book should be mostly useful and require little hand waving on my part - but I go in assuming I will change things to suit me. All that to say while I am (somewhat) disappointed by a lack of direct PC options in the book, I can handle it and make it work for me.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I always homerule and mangle metaplot and lore to my liking.<br /> Homeruling isn't what I'm doing with V5. What I'm having to do with V5 is tear the game down completely with <i>everything new added</i> and basically make my own alternate 5th edition with the pieces. I thought it might be a temporary thing and that the further into development things went, the less I would have to do so. Clearly not. At this point it's time to stop trying and accept that this isn't meant for me.<br /> <br /> Homeruling involves a lot of fussing, and discussion with people not familiar with these rules. You can't walk into a session expecting to play one game and have to learn an entirely new one.<br /> <br /> There was enough in V5 I liked to use it, so now I'm going to have to decide what to do with the bits I like. The creators have declared that this product will not be for me, and I will have to return to previous editions.<br /> I've still got V20, so honestly after the initial anger wore off I found that I'm not that upset, just disapointed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":26836,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","user":"Rhywbeth","date":". 05-27-2021, 10:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T09:07:12-07:00","id":1449808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rhywbeth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449793#post1449793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why, exactly, is V5 so hellbent on everyone playing it being Anarch or Camarilla?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mainly because V5 is fueled by a nostalgia for VtM 1st edition. A lot of what got set in stone in later editions was open-ended in 1st edition. The Sabbat were mysterious adversaries, the Camarilla/Anarch divide was the core vampire conflict, the Masquerade was a serious issue, Lupines weren't Garou yet, etc. The Independents were off-script side players. Even the basic Camarilla structure wasn't established as the default worldwide, merely the default for Chicago.<br /> <br /> The Sabbat was meant to be the road you shouldn't go down, a point of no return. Only later work was done to make them playable and not everyone thought those additions to the game were improvements. The Paths, for example, were always a point of controversy as arguably detracting from the core theme.<br /> <br /> Obviously at this point, though, I imagine it would be easier to make the Sabbat playable by toning down the monstrous fascism rather than just eliminating them as player options entirely.<br /> <br /> But that being said, if your core vision of the game is set by the template established in the 1st edition corebook + Chicago By Night + The Hunters Hunted and basically nothing else, the playable Sabbat aren't really compatible with that vision, so it's understandable they'd commit to keeping them an antagonist group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":543,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","user":"Professor Phobos","date":". 05-27-2021, 12:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","name":"Professor Phobos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T09:11:16-07:00","id":1449810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rhywbeth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449793#post1449793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The creators have declared that this product will not be for me, and I will have to return to previous editions.<br /> I've still got V20, so honestly after the initial anger wore off I found that I'm not that upset, just disapointed.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not going quite that far, since I like many of the new mechanics, like Messy Critical/Bestial Failures, and single opposed rolls for combat/conflict rounds. And Long Road Out of Hell allows me to bring Paths into V5. But right now it seems like I literally have no reason to ever, EVER get anything but the core book and Long Road Out Of Hell. Which is a boost to my pocketbook, I guess, but is still really disappointing.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T09:28:37-07:00","id":1449812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rhywbeth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449793#post1449793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I cycled rapidly through several reactions. They were all negative.<br /> I've settled on an exhausted sort of disdain.<br /> <br /> First the independents get shot. The Followers of Set have been destroyed and absorbed into Camarilla and Anarchs. The Hecata (while I like them) have supplanted the Giovanni and related enemy/rival necromancer bloodlines. The Assamites are Camarilla. I have no idea what they've done to the Ravnos, but I don't think the writers have ever known what to do with those guys. They're basically extinct anyway.<br /> Despite watching the independents disappear, I was sure the Sabbat wouldn't.<br /> <br /> And now the Sabbat have been relagated to NPC status.<br /> <br /> Why, exactly, is V5 so hellbent on everyone playing it being Anarch or Camarilla?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oddly, this isn't true according to CULTS OF THE BLOOD GODS as now cities are under the control of cults too. The Camarilla and Anarchs are just two sects versus huge numbers of them now.<br /> <br /> You can be anything now.<br /> <br /> Assamite, Church of Nephilim now.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T10:33:13-07:00","id":1449819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449812#post1449812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oddly, this isn't true according to CULTS OF THE BLOOD GODS as now cities are under the control of cults too. The Camarilla and Anarchs are just two sects versus huge numbers of them now.</div> </div> </div> </div>So there's one reality for the people who only own the core book <i>and a completely different reality</i> for people who also own this one non-core sourcebook?<br /> This seems a little too divergent. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449812#post1449812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can be anything now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just not Sabbat. <br /> And there's actual rules for creating PC blood cult members or joining them? Like, running entire chronicles as a blood cult?<br /> They're fine with you being a member of the Blood of Satan's Own Get blood cult, but not Sabbat?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1807-serpent-axis","name":"Serpent Axis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1807_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T10:46:04-07:00","id":1449821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Serpent Axis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449819#post1449819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So there's one reality for the people who only own the core book <i>and a completely different reality</i> for people who also own this one non-core sourcebook?<br /> This seems a little too divergent.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Just not Sabbat.<br /> And there's actual rules for creating PC blood cult members or joining them? Like, running entire chronicles as a blood cult?<br /> They're fine with you being a member of the Blood of Satan's Own Get blood cult, but not Sabbat?</div> </div> </div> </div>The thing is about those Cults, they still take humanity as a given. They aren't alternatives to being human, they just have some Convictions that mitigate humanity loss a little. They are determined to shove humanity down our throats, and only allow playable alternatives that slow you circling the humanity drain slightly. They are just absolutely sold on the idea that vampire is about humanity, humanity, humanity. The idea that someone would want to truly explore a different species is utterly alien to these game designers. They are just giving us a flat no, so we can only respond to them with a flat no in turn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T10:55:04-07:00","id":1449822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Serpent Axis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449819#post1449819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So there's one reality for the people who only own the core book <i>and a completely different reality</i> for people who also own this one non-core sourcebook?<br /> This seems a little too divergent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it?<br /> <br /> I mean, that's the nature of supplements. They expand the universe.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1449578-pre-orders-open-for-the-sabbat-book?p=1449821#post1449821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The thing is about those Cults, they still take humanity as a given. They aren't alternatives to being human, they just have some Convictions that mitigate humanity loss a little. They are determined to shove humanity down our throats, and only allow playable alternatives that slow you circling the humanity drain slightly. They are just absolutely sold on the idea that vampire is about humanity, humanity, humanity. The idea that someone would want to truly explore a different species is utterly alien to these game designers. They are just giving us a flat no, so we can only respond to them with a flat no in turn.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except V5 Humanity means that you can have the Conviction of, &quot;Suffer not a Baby To Live.&quot;<br /> <br /> Also, the Chronicle Tenet of, &quot;Kill anyone who disrespects Kayne.&quot;<br /> <br /> Humanity isn't humane anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.t